      "date": "2026-05-11",
      "cta_string": "Try it now",
      "cta_url": "https://www.patreon.com/c/BeneosTokens",
      "news_text": "<p>Every Beneos creature now ships with a true top-down token in addition to the 2.5D portrait. Right-click any creature on the canvas to switch styles in place — perfect for grid combat. The Cloud search exposes both variants and the new <strong>Default Style</strong> filter lets you pick which one drag-and-drop installs land as.</p><p>Coming up next: matching 2.5D companion tokens for every new top-down variant, plus per-creature effect animations (poison auras, lightning, more).</p>",
